      "created_at": "2015-08-12T03:07:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Savage Mana allows you to put a target that Haka destroys under Savage Mana.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Prime Warden Captain Cosmic's base power allows you to shuffle a destroyed construct into your deck and then either draw or play a card.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If Haka destroys a construct, can it be shuffled into Captain Cosmic's deck and then placed under Savage Mana? Can it be placed under Savage Mana and then shuffled into Captain Cosmic's deck?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My intuition is that you have to choose one or the other of these, you don't get to do both, but I'm not 100% sure.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:12.692Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
