    {
      "id": 146135,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-12T11:49:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you choose to use PW Captain Cosmic's power to shuffle the Construct into his deck after the card has gone under Savage Mana then you defeated the purpose of putting it under Savage Mana. &nbsp;Both may be able to trigger but you can't gain benefit from both effects. &nbsp;Either Captain Cosmic has it shuffled into his deck and draws or plays a card or Haka has an additional card under Savage Mana. &nbsp;</p><p>Edit: if this does work exactly like Omnitron and Savage Mana then the only outcome is that the construct is ultimately shuffled into Captain Cosmic's deck and then he gets to play or draw a card. &nbsp;</p>",
