      "name": "AlexxKay",
      "username": "AlexxKay",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-12T22:01:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>According to the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/tZfiNqJyV3rK-QAsuSFG33w/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Damage Dealing Timing worksheet</a>*, PW Captain Cosmic triggers in step 17, and Savage Mana in step 18.&nbsp; So PWCC has to decide first, then Haka gets the option to use Savage Mana if PWCC lets the destruction happen..</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>* Man, I gotta get around to adding external citations to that...</p>",
