      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>According to the text of Prime Wardens Captain Cosmic, the timing worksheet is wrong. &nbsp;Step 17 applies to cards that say &quot;would be destroyed&quot; (like Unforgiving Wasteland), indicating that the effect replaces the destruction. &nbsp;Cards that say &quot;is destroyed&quot; (like PWCC) respond to the destruction rather than replace it, and are handled by step 18. &nbsp;It could be that PWCC is <em>intended</em>&nbsp;to be a replacement effect but was worded as a response effect, in which case the text should be changed from &quot;is&quot; to &quot;would be&quot; (this has happened before).</p>",
      "actions_summary": [
